### ==========================================
### MRP API - Complete Test Collection
### Run these IN ORDER from top to bottom!
### ==========================================

### ====================
### 1. USER SETUP
### ====================

### 1.1 Register User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "pass123"
}

###

### 1.2 Login User
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "pass123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
    client.log("✓ Token saved: " + response.body.token);
%}

###

### ====================
### 2. CREATE MEDIA (Run all 3)
### ====================

### 2.1 Create Movie
POST http://localhost:8080/api/media
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception",
  "description": "Sci-fi thriller about dreams",
  "mediaType": "MOVIE",
  "releaseYear": 2010,
  "genres": ["sci-fi", "thriller"],
  "ageRestriction": 12
}

> {%
    client.global.set("media_id", response.body.id);
    client.log("✓ Movie created: " + response.body.id);
%}

###

### 2.2 Create Series
POST http://localhost:8080/api/media
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Breaking Bad",
  "description": "Crime drama series",
  "mediaType": "SERIES",
  "releaseYear": 2008,
  "genres": ["drama", "crime"],
  "ageRestriction": 18
}

> {%
    client.global.set("series_id", response.body.id);
    client.log("✓ Series created: " + response.body.id);
%}

###

### 2.3 Create Game
POST http://localhost:8080/api/media
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Last of Us",
  "description": "Post-apocalyptic action game",
  "mediaType": "GAME",
  "releaseYear": 2013,
  "genres": ["action", "adventure"],
  "ageRestriction": 18
}

> {%
    client.global.set("game_id", response.body.id);
    client.log("✓ Game created: " + response.body.id);
%}

###

### ====================
### 3. VIEW MEDIA
### ====================

### 3.1 Get All Media
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### 3.2 Get Specific Media
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media/{{media_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### 3.3 Search by Title
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media/search?title=incep
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### 3.4 Filter by Genre
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media?genre=sci-fi
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### 3.5 Filter by Type (Movies only)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media?type=MOVIE
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### 3.6 Sort by Rating
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media?sort=rating
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### 3.7 Combined Filter (Action movies, sorted by rating)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/media?genre=action&type=MOVIE&sort=rating
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### ====================
### 4. UPDATE/DELETE MEDIA
### ====================

### 4.1 Update Media
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/media/{{media_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception (Updated)",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "mediaType": "MOVIE",
  "releaseYear": 2010,
  "genres": ["sci-fi", "action"],
  "ageRestriction": 16
}

###

### 4.2 Delete Game (can only delete your own media)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/media/{{game_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### ====================
### 5. RATINGS (Run 5.1 first!)
### ====================

### 5.1 Create Rating ⚠️ RUN THIS FIRST!
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mediaId": "{{media_id}}",
  "stars": 5,
  "comment": "Amazing movie!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("rating_id", response.body.id);
    client.log("✓ Rating created: " + response.body.id);
%}

###

### 5.2 Get Ratings for Media
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ratings/media/{{media_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### 5.3 Update Rating (only after 5.1!)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/ratings/{{rating_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stars": 4,
  "comment": "Changed my mind, still great!"
}

###

### 5.4 Confirm Rating Comment (make it public)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ratings/{{rating_id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### ====================
### 6. SECOND USER (for testing likes)
### ====================

### 6.1 Register User 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user2",
  "password": "pass456"
}

###

### 6.2 Login User 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user2",
  "password": "pass456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("auth_token2", response.body.token);
    client.log("✓ User2 token saved: " + response.body.token);
%}

###

### 6.3 User2 Likes User1's Rating
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ratings/{{rating_id}}/like
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token2}}

###

### 6.4 User2 Creates Their Own Rating
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ratings
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token2}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mediaId": "{{series_id}}",
  "stars": 5,
  "comment": "Best series ever!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("rating_id2", response.body.id);
    client.log("✓ User2 rating created: " + response.body.id);
%}

###

### ====================
### 7. FAVORITES
### ====================

### 7.1 Add to Favorites
POST http://localhost:8080/api/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mediaId": "{{media_id}}"
}

###

### 7.2 Add Series to Favorites
POST http://localhost:8080/api/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mediaId": "{{series_id}}"
}

###

### 7.3 Get All Favorites
GET http://localhost:8080/api/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### 7.4 Remove from Favorites
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/favorites/{{media_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### ====================
### 8. RECOMMENDATIONS
### ====================

### 8.1 Get Recommendations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### 8.2 Get Recommendations (limited to 5)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommendations?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### ====================
### 9. USER PROFILE & LEADERBOARD
### ====================

### 9.1 Get User Profile
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/user1/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### 9.2 Get Leaderboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/leaderboard
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

###

### ====================
### 10. DELETE OPERATIONS
### ====================

### 10.1 Delete Rating
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/ratings/{{rating_id2}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token2}}

###

### ==========================================
### TROUBLESHOOTING
### ==========================================
### If you get "unsubstituted variable" errors:
### 1. Run requests from TOP TO BOTTOM in order
### 2. Make sure you see "✓ Token saved" etc. in console
### 3. Check the Run panel for saved variables
### 4. If stuck, restart from step 1 (Register User)
### ==========================================